stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Suppressed: dedup or cooldown
  Draft --> Fired: passes thresholds
  Fired --> Confirmed: book tier confirms
  Fired --> Dropped: book tier denies
  Confirmed --> Resolved: outcome window closes
  Resolved --> Graded: journal metrics computed
  Graded --> [*]
  Dropped --> [*]: counted for precision
